        "id": 19434
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-07T14:58:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, we still plan to support this for vulkan device that natively supports it. The code using this feature is still here in Graphite. Most Dawn backends just don\u0027t expose this feature currently so the MSAARenderToSingleSampled is mostly unused right now.",
